IPMARK-iptables-1.2.8-patch is a patch on the iptables source tree
(adds libipt_IPMARK.c and .IPMARK-test).

IPMARK-patch-o-matic-patch is a patch on the patch-o-matic tree
(adds IPMARK.patch, IPMARK.patch.config.in, IPMARK.patch.configure.help,
IPMARK.patch.help, IPMARK.patch.makefile and IPMARK.patch.tar.gz

These patches don't change any earlier files, they only add new ones, so
they sholud patch on every tree.

